   "date": "2013-03-18",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "A motion was moved to suspend standing orders so that the Appropriation Bill (No. 3) 2012‑2013 and Appropriation Bill (No. 4) 2012‑2013 could be considered during the current sittings, with a statement of reasons citing additional funding for decisions made after the 2012‑2013 budget and the need for passage before the end of the Autumn sittings to avoid delays. The motion was agreed to."
